      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start and professional, but i think the score might be a bit lower than we need for a \"gold standard\" example. if we want to illustrate the absolute upper limit of what this tool can register, could you try making it even more positive? \n\ni know it's a customer complaint, so keep it somewhat realistic, but really lean into the positivity. try to push that index as high as humanly possible. we need to see what the tool considers a \"perfect\" score.",
